<section image-layout="blank" id="MEH7JnFVcB"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="uQ6HqyM0X3" background-color="accent" padding="28pt 12pt 24pt" colspan="7"><p role="eyebrow">Field guide</p><spacer mode="fill"></spacer><p role="caption">SERVICE</p><p role="caption">04 / 10</p></grid-item><grid-item id="RdiGtbaFJ3" padding="22pt 30pt 20pt 28pt" colspan="53"><labels><label variant="outline">Illustrative replacement · validate before use</label></labels><h2 font-size="28pt">How a request moves through the service</h2><p font-size="16pt">Six outputs isolate failures instead of treating the service as one undifferentiated problem.</p><grid marker="number" marker-rule="true" marker-position="above" marker-align="start" marker-numbering-format="decimal-leading-zero" spacing="small" style="--marker-gap:0.45em"><grid-item colspan="20"><h4>Capture</h4><p font-size="16pt">Normalize email, chat, or web input.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="20"><h4>Validate</h4><p font-size="16pt">Check fields, identity, consent, and duplicates.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="20"><h4>Classify</h4><p font-size="16pt">Assign category, priority, and confidence.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="20"><h4>Route</h4><p font-size="16pt">Select queue by category, region, and hours.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="20"><h4>Work</h4><p font-size="16pt">Record assignment, response, status, and resolution.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="20"><h4>Observe</h4><p font-size="16pt">Export queue, accuracy, backlog, and overrides.</p></grid-item></grid><grid spacing="small" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item cell-style="subtle" colspan="20"><h4>Controls span the chain</h4><p font-size="16pt">Identity and audit logging apply at every stage.</p></grid-item><grid-item cell-style="subtle" colspan="20"><h4>Reporting is asynchronous</h4><p font-size="16pt">Intake continues when analytics is delayed.</p></grid-item><grid-item cell-style="subtle" colspan="20"><h4>Failures remain recoverable</h4><p font-size="16pt">Invalid records enter review; none are discarded.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>